      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The Second Joint Task Force of European Societies on Coronary Prevention (EAS-European Atherosclerosis Society, ESC-European Society of Cardiology, ESH-European Society of Hypertension) have established recommendations for the prevention of coronary heart disease in cooperation with the representatives of the International Society of Behavioral Medicine, the European Society of General Medicine/Family Medicine, and the European Heart-Network. These recommendations of the year 1998 are commented by Austrian cardiologists and lipidologists and supplemented with recent clinical findings."},
